diff --git a/CHANGELOG.rst b/CHANGELOG.rst
index bad4e19e..b365bf1f 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.rst
+++ b/CHANGELOG.rst
@@ -6,7 +6,11 @@ Changelog
 
 Bug fixes:
 
-- `marshmallow.validate.URL` accepts Internationalized Domain Names (IDNs) (:issue:`2821`).
+- `marshmallow.validate.URL` and `marshmallow.validate.Email` accept
+  Internationalized Domain Names (IDNs) (:issue:`2821`, :issue:`2936`).
+  `marshmallow.validate.Email` also accepts internationalized local parts that
+  use combining marks, e.g. in Bengali or Devanagari, and correctly rejects IDN
+  domains with leading or trailing hyphens.
   Thanks :user:`touhidurrr` for the report.
 - Typing: Fix typing of ``netsted`` in `marshmallow.fields.Nested` (:pr:`2935`).
 
